ich_text","block_id":"QNUfE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26923ea3-86b3-4c08-8a8b-1021fcb38758","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9699919799/utilities/find.html\u003e\n原典見てみました。なさそう。","ts":"1631518780.295900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sDsAw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eda4a85a-6984-487d-8ed9-f003b190a3d7","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"ついでに POSIX 準拠かどうか知りませんが、`-execdir` というオプションもあります。ファイルが見つかった場所をカレントディレクトリとしてコマンドを実行するというやつ。たまに便利。","ts":"1631518473.295400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y2xY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6f3ac4e-0e90-4a55-9167-07d5134bd23e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/ko1nksm/items/f56753ab7d882c5f9092#%E7%8F%BE%E5%AE%9F%E3%81%B8%E3%81%AE%E5%BD%B1%E9%9F%BF\u003e\n怖すぎる\n```$ cat list.txt\nfoo\nbar\n_\nbaz\n\n$ cat list.txt | xargs\nfoo bar```","ts":"1631518457.295100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: 誰も知らない xargs の仕様と入力形式とPOSIXの罠 「ある環境では _ がきたらそこで処理終了ですよ」 - Qiita","id":1,"title":"誰も知らない xargs の仕様と入力形式とPOSIXの罠 「ある環境では _ がきたらそこで処理終了ですよ」 - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/ko1nksm/items/f56753ab7d882c5f9092#%E7%8F%BE%E5%AE%9F%E3%81%B8%E3%81%AE%E5%BD%B1%E9%9F%BF","text":"はじめに xargs の仕様はよくわからないし罠もあります。みんな気軽に使ってばかりで、詳細を誰もまとめてくれてないのでまとめました。もちろん誰も知らないってことはないのでしょうが、よく使われるコマンドの割にこれらの話を書いてい...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.qiita.com%2Fassets%2Fpublic%2Farticle-ogp-background-1150d8b18a7c15795b701a55ae908f94.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0\u0026w=1200\u0026mark64=aHR0cHM6Ly9xaWl0YS11c2VyLWNvbnRlbnRzLmltZ2l4Lm5ldC9-\u0026mark-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend64=aHR0cHM6Ly9xaWl0YS11c2VyLWNvbnRlbnRzLmltZ2l4Lm5ldC9-dGV4dD9peGxpYj1yYi00LjAuMCZ3PTg0MCZoPTUwMCZ0eHQ2ND1RR3R2TVc1cmMyMCZ0eHQtY29sb3I9JTIzMzMzJnR4dC1mb250PUhpcmFnaW5vJTIwU2FucyUyMFc2JnR4dC1zaXplPTQ1JnR4dC1hbGlnbj1yaWdodCUyQ2JvdHRvbSZzPTY5NzU3ZTZmODA3YmFmYjUxM2Y1OTU5ZmIwOWNlODUx\u0026blend-align=center%2Cmiddle\u0026blend-mode=normal\u0026s=057a79ddad95add69a6399d41e6c8a21","blocks":null,"service_name":"Qiita","service_icon":"https://cdn.qiita.com/assets/favicons/public/apple-touch-icon-ec5ba42a24ae923f16825592efdc356f.png","from_url":"https://qiita.com/ko1nksm/items/f56753ab7d882c5f9092#%E7%8F%BE%E5%AE%9F%E3%81%B8%E3%81%AE%E5%BD%B1%E9%9F%BF","original_url":"https://qiita.com/ko1nksm/items/f56753ab7d882c5f9092#%E7%8F%BE%E5%AE%9F%E3%81%B8%E3%81%AE%E5%BD%B1%E9%9F%BF"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ooOP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a89e96b-77f1-4597-a3f4-286b6312df08","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"UNIX を教わったのがそれより昔なのでもう記憶をアップデートするしかない。","ts":"1631518297.292600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FH3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fc30504-9c9a-455d-baac-a68da1520952","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"記事によると `+` が POSIX に入ったのは 2004年だそうで","ts":"1631518255.292000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Auo=t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb7fd10f-94ec-470d-b6b8-333174524c4d","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u0026gt; なぜ -exec {} + はあまり使われてないのか？\nここか。","ts":"1631518200.291100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NYQe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8845dc6-662d-4a77-9a6b-370a7954be85","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あー、そうなんだ。いつ入ったんだろう。","ts":"1631518152.290900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fXS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fd7c936-e44e-407e-b2bf-653e530cb0ea","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ただ、好き度で言えばxargsがパイプっぽい感じがして好きなんですが、こっちのほうが安全そう。","ts":"1631518030.290600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HqLlA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4446cef7-5358-4081-ace0-e29061c39baf","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"へー。-print0と-0が面倒だなーと思ってたのでこれはいいですね。","ts":"1631518009.290100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"se0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"211d1cff-9bb4-4e5f-8d36-dfd6d9cc4652","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`-r` って何だっけと思ったら、何も見つからなかったときの話でしたか。それも `-exec {} +` なら問題ないと上の記事に書いてありますね。","ts":"1631517788.289300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jcni"}]},{"client_msg_id":"18fcea6e-5bc9-4f8d-bdd3-ca5a6cd2b647","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"出来た！と思って cron に仕込んだら、何もないケースでエラー出てるのを朝見るというアレ。","ts":"1631517506.287700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EdHF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ef39e4c-dfff-4fa3-b460-88f64bd981a3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"`-r` は付けて欲しい。","ts":"1631517464.287000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lsQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5fc65ae3-0dc6-4885-8dbd-00a29ef06c2b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あー、そういう意味なのか。","ts":"1631517419.286800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IHy+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86cd03b6-5431-4b2f-ad2b-089c97dd28d6","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"それは `;` の話で、`+` はそうではないというのが上の記事です。","ts":"1631517330.286500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jAA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"897ef7a2-a025-47b2-b268-571e7ef70940","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"find だけでやると行毎にプロセス実行されるから非効率ってのはありますね。","ts":"1631517266.285600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W+xQW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ec25551-ab16-4f5d-ae5d-c56fe6320daa","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`;`の構文の印象がアレすぎたので無い物扱いしていたけど`+`でxargs likeなことできるならいいな","ts":"1631516640.283100","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1631516694.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ei/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac75fb71-22ee-4bd6-8cab-d879bc994908","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"xargs派","ts":"1631516618.282400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Thw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4877809-b07d-483d-9093-1a33bfebc5af","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"-exec好き","ts":"1631516539.281400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ysu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fb34c89a-f260-41f9-a662-e6ec57465525","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"なんかググりづらいのもあって辛いですね `-exec {} +`","ts":"1631516517.281000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lhzbd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4d865862-c69a-49cb-ba51-659f639434cb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですねえ","ts":"1631516428.280300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u4d4m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6187e9a6-27cb-4d10-afdb-5f84d89fdbb7","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"`find -exec {} +` が POSIX 準拠で、`find -print0 | xargs -0` がそうではないというのは知らなかった。\n\u003chttps://qiita.com/ko1nksm/items/9ff1f212255e8520070c\u003e","ts":"1631516375.280000","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: POSIX 準拠のシェルスクリプトでは find | xargs よりも find -exec {} + を使うべき！ - Qiita","id":1,"title":"POSIX 準拠のシェルスクリプトでは find | xargs よりも find -exec {} + を使うべき！ - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/ko1nksm/item